hpc:Projectgroup a owl:Class .
hpc:License a owl:Class .
hpc:Feature a owl:Class .
hpc:mode a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:Servicedomain a owl:Class .
hpc:total a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:distribution a owl:DatatypeProperty .

hpc:Projectgroup rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class .
hpc:License rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class .
hpc:Feature rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class .

hpc:Mode rdf:domain hpc:License ;
    rdfs:range hpc:Mode .

hpc:ServiceDomain rdf:domain hpc:License ;
    rdfs:range rdf:Literal .

hpc:Total rdf:domain hpc:ProjectGroup ;
    rdfs:range xsd:integer .

hpc:Distribution rdf:domain hpc:ProjectGroup ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

hpc:Distribution rdfs:range finds(?project ?percentage ?number_licenses_owned) .

hpc:finds a owl:ObjectProperty .


This ontology fragment defines classes for `ProjectGroup`, `License`, and `Feature`. It also defines object properties for `Mode` and `Distribution`, and datatype properties for `Total` and `Distribution`. The `Distribution` property is further defined to have a range of a custom function `finds(?project ?percentage ?number_licenses_owned)`.
